Does anyone know of good ways to coax your pet into dropping something
for you?

You see, I've got this suspicion that my pet yellow dragon is carrying
my BoH, and I'd kinda like to get at the contents.  It's really becoming
annoying of him to do that.  (killing monsters for me, I don't mind).

The first time I noticed this new habit was on the castle level.
We both gleefully tag-teamed the folks at the drawbridge, until I
figured it was safe enough to fight from inside the keep.  After
all the dust of battle died down, I decided to go stuff my 20-odd
new rations into my BoH, back outside in front of the drawbridge.
And when I went out, it wasn't there!

My big fear at that time was that the dragon had absently picked it
up and dropped it into the moat.  Since I still had no AoMB, I
wasn't sure that walking into the moat at random places was going
to help.  I decided I'd just come back for it later, maybe after
wishing for the right things.  Some time later, the dragon showed
up, and dropped the BoH.  Apparently he had been carrying it the
whole time!

Well, we go on down to the next level, and like usual, I thought
I'd drop my BoH someplace nearby, so I would be unencumbered in
combat.  (Even though it only has 2 wands, one weapon, and only those
spellbooks I actually find useful, the bag still stresses me.
Must be all the food, gems, $, and holy water)

Well, this next level has been cleared for some time, but I haven't
seen my BoH!  I haven't heard any slurping sounds, so I'm sure it is
still intact.  As far as I know, no-one else would be interested in it.
I'd like to get at it so I can pay my proper respects to a priestess
I found here.  I'm forced to suspect my pet dragon is carrying it.

How can I be sure?  He's merrily picking up other things and dropping
things.  For all I know, he does that in a stack-like (LIFO) fashion,
and may never get around to dropping the BoH.  I can only suspect that
he has it, but I don't know how to find out for sure.

If I were to throw tripe at him, would he be more willing to give me
the BoH?  If so, that's a real happy thought.  The BoH itself probably
has half-dozen of those.... :)

